// Project-owned Module Expansion captain travel menu.
{1}{Welcome aboard. The tide is fair and my ship is ready. Where shall I set our course?}{Welcome aboard. The tide is fair and my ship is ready. Where shall I set our course?}{}{1}{}{ }
{2}{Take me to Vormantown.}{}{1}{}{-10}{ }
{3}{Take me to Dungeon Crawl 2.}{}{1}{}{-20}{ }
{4}{Take me to Buried Secrets.}{}{1}{}{-30}{ }
{5}{More destinations.}{}{1}{}{60}{ }
{6}{Never mind.}{}{1}{}{390}{ }
{10}{Vormantown, then. We'll weigh anchor with the tide and make straight for its harbor.}{Vormantown, then. We'll weigh anchor with the tide and make straight for its harbor.}{}{10}{}{ }
{20}{Bound for the dungeon ruins? The approach is treacherous, but I've sailed worse.}{Bound for the dungeon ruins? The approach is treacherous, but I've sailed worse.}{}{20}{}{ }
{30}{Buried Secrets, is it? An ill-omened shore, by all accounts. We'll leave on the tide.}{Buried Secrets, is it? An ill-omened shore, by all accounts. We'll leave on the tide.}{}{30}{}{ }
{40}{Dusty Dunes it is. Keep plenty of water close; the heat there is merciless.}{Dusty Dunes it is. Keep plenty of water close; the heat there is merciless.}{}{40}{}{ }
{50}{Hellgate? That's no pleasure cruise. Still, if you're determined, I'll take you.}{Hellgate? That's no pleasure cruise. Still, if you're determined, I'll take you.}{}{50}{}{ }
{55}{White Sands, then. With fair winds, I'll have you safely ashore by dawn.}{White Sands, then. With fair winds, I'll have you safely ashore by dawn.}{}{55}{}{ }
{60}{Let's have another look at the chart. Which shore are you bound for?}{Let's have another look at the chart. Which shore are you bound for?}{}{60}{}{ }
