{99}{Back to your private quarters? Very well. I'll have you home before the lamps are lit.}{Back to your private quarters? Very well. I'll have you home before the lamps are lit.}{}{99}{}{ }
{110}{Aye, Vormantown. I'll have the crew make ready and catch the turning tide.}{Aye, Vormantown. I'll have the crew make ready and catch the turning tide.}{}{110}{}{ }
{120}{The dungeon passage, then. Keep your weapons close when we make landfall.}{The dungeon passage, then. Keep your weapons close when we make landfall.}{}{120}{}{ }
{130}{We sail for Buried Secrets. Whatever waits there, I'd sooner leave it buried.}{We sail for Buried Secrets. Whatever waits there, I'd sooner leave it buried.}{}{130}{}{ }
{140}{A course for Dusty Dunes. Drink deep before we land, and don't underestimate that sun.}{A course for Dusty Dunes. Drink deep before we land, and don't underestimate that sun.}{}{140}{}{ }
{150}{Hellgate it is. I'll brave the waters; what you do after landing is your affair.}{Hellgate it is. I'll brave the waters; what you do after landing is your affair.}{}{150}{}{ }
{155}{A course for White Sands. Fair-looking coast, but fair shores can hide sharp rocks.}{A course for White Sands. Fair-looking coast, but fair shores can hide sharp rocks.}{}{155}{}{ }
{170}{We'll make for the Lost Dungeon of Souls. I hope your courage outlasts the voyage.}{We'll make for the Lost Dungeon of Souls. I hope your courage outlasts the voyage.}{}{170}{}{ }
{175}{Bound for the Deathmatch grounds? Very well. Steel yourself before we reach the shore.}{Bound for the Deathmatch grounds? Very well. Steel yourself before we reach the shore.}{}{175}{}{ }
{190}{Then we sail for Time. Don't ask me how it sits on a chart; it simply does.}{Then we sail for Time. Don't ask me how it sits on a chart; it simply does.}{}{190}{}{ }
{195}{Woodmir it is. If the wind holds, we'll reach the course before the crowds.}{Woodmir it is. If the wind holds, we'll reach the course before the crowds.}{}{195}{}{ }
{199}{Your own quarters? A sensible destination for once. I'll see you safely home.}{Your own quarters? A sensible destination for once. I'll see you safely home.}{}{199}{}{ }
